    "title": "LLC Board of Trustees Announces Formal Dedication Of New Plaza - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dalton Ewer ,\n21 hours ago The Lake Land College Board of Trustees (LLCBT) has announced a formal dedication of the new Sullivan Plaza set to begin at 8:30 AM on Thursday, October 8th. The plaza will be dedicated posthumously in honor of LLC former trustee and alumnus Mike Sullivan during the ceremony. Sullivan was among... Read full article",
